      <rules>
        <rule id="ing-arkhan-unit-0001-master-cyber" name="Master Cybertheurgist: Magister Machinis" publicationId="b8c9-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c-6d7e8f9a0b1c" hidden="false">
          <description>Arkhan Land has all the Rites and weapons that are part of the Artificia Machina and Artificia Cybernetica arcanas.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ing-arkhan-unit-0001-high-tech" name="High Techno-arcana: Technoarchaeologica" publicationId="b8c9-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c-6d7e8f9a0b1c" hidden="false">
          <description>If Arkhan Land is holding an objective marker at the start of the Controlling Player&apos;s turn, he may investigate it (cannot Move or Charge that turn). If within 3&quot; at end of turn, gain 1 VP.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ing-arkhan-unit-0001-sapien" name="Sapien" publicationId="b8c9-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c-6d7e8f9a0b1c" hidden="false">
          <description>Sapien grants all benefits of a Cyber-Familiar. Arkhan Land may make one additional attack per turn with Sapien&apos;s Sting.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
